{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are running a space based table top campaign and need a place to track the worlds your players visit, want to visually share the universe you created for them to play in, or want to track your observations of our night sky and imagine what could be out there, Stellar Navigator has you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Navigator provides a unique toolset which allows you to build your dream galaxy and all the solar systems therein. You choose how to light up the night sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft a unique galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/extras/fe93aef2b8a5cce9d2ed03ae855e6013.avif?t=1743189838\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/extras_big/fe93aef2b8a5cce9d2ed03ae855e6013.avif?t=1743189838 width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why stop at one solar system? Fill an entire galaxy! In the galaxy view, additional details may be added to each solar system and the background image and overlay can by modified.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give life to your solar systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/extras/7cfc679f55415cc552f095b308ce85ff.poster.avif?t=1743189838\" width=800 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/extras/7cfc679f55415cc552f095b308ce85ff.webm?t=1743189838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/extras/7cfc679f55415cc552f095b308ce85ff.mp4?t=1743189838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solar Systems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add planetary bodies, moons, asteroids, black holes, and comets to each solar system and mark them up with the label system and markers. Or modify the asteroid belt's size scale and distance from its star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Navigator offers creators the ability describe each of their planets and add planetary properties to further set worlds apart. These properties include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual type of the planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes which are present on the planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements (both known elements and the ability to create your own!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural Satellites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temperature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day length</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images with square or hexagonal grid overlays (or none) in a landscape or 1:1 layout for table top space combat games. Stellar Navigator also comes with a system tour mode that can run quietly in the background as a visual aid during your tabletop game sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features &amp; Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar navigator has been built to be used on small format screens as well as ultrawide monitors (E.g., 32:9 aspect ratio).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stellar Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3359980/b1484304d7ff05c122e5ca5736d6ce6b2212d49d.jpg"},{"name":"Stellar Astronomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta