_paragraph\" >Biomes which are present on the planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements (both known elements and the ability to create your own!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural Satellites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temperature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day length</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export images with square or hexagonal grid overlays (or none) in a landscape or 1:1 layout for table top space combat games. Stellar Navigator also comes with a system tour mode that can run quietly in the background as a visual aid during your tabletop game sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features &amp; Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar navigator has been built to be used on small format screens as well as ultrawide monitors (E.g., 32:9 aspect ratio).</p>","developers":["Cathexis Digital Design"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359980/header.jpg?t=1743189838","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359980/789052/71f514b2700e7395866b2412ca9c23b1a41305be/1750844287/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732849117","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359980/789052/71f514b2700